  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until softened.",
    "Add the diced scotch bonnet peppers and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped collard greens and cook until wilted.",
    "Add the ground allspice, dried thyme, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Use a spoon to shape the stew into nigiri-like shapes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs."
